# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo holds PIPELINE CODE ONLY. All sequencing data, references and
# pipeline outputs live outside it (../data, ../../reference) and must never be
# committed -- a single plate's intermediates are ~9 GB per stage.
#
# NB the patterns below are deliberately targeted rather than blanket
# extensions: *.tsv and *.txt are NOT ignored, because barcode whitelists
# (I_Gene_expression/a_Mapping/bc_celseq2.tsv), Snakemake configs
# (samples.tsv, units.tsv) and gene lists (Mus_musculus_TF.txt) are tracked
# config that the pipeline needs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- python bytecode -------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- raw + intermediate sequencing data ------------------------------------
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
*.fq
*.fq.gz
*.sam
*.bam
*.bam.bai
*.cram
*.sai
*.bed.gz
*.pickle
*.pickle.gz

# --- references (built locally, tens of GB) --------------------------------
*.fa
*.fasta
*.fa.gz
*.fasta.gz
*.gtf
*.gtf.gz
*.fa.amb
*.fa.ann
*.fa.bwt
*.fa.pac
*.fa.sa
star_index*/

# --- mapping-pipeline outputs ----------------------------------------------
# stage 1-5 per-cell intermediates and stage 6-7 count tables
*_cbc.fastq.gz
*_cbc_trimmed*
*.nonRibo*
*-ribo.bam
*Aligned.out*
*Log.final.txt
*Log.progress.out
*_STARtmp/
*_genes.bed.gz
*_trimming_report.txt
*ReadCounts.tsv
*UFICounts.tsv
*TranscriptCounts.tsv
*_mapStats.log
.cells.manifest
checkme.txt

# working/output folders produced by the drivers
vasaplate_out*/
smoketest/

# --- SLURM job logs --------------------------------------------------------
slurm-*.out
*.err
*.out

# --- editor / OS cruft -----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# FLASH-seq QC: the notebook is generated from build_notebook.py, and its
# executed copy (with figures inlined) belongs in res/flashseq/, not in git.
flashseq/__pycache__/
